classDiagram
    direction TB

    class PaymentProcessor {
        -Map~String, PaymentStrategy~ strategies
        +registerStrategy(PaymentStrategy strategy) void
        +processPayment(String provider, amount) PaymentResult
    }

    class PaymentStrategy {
        <<interface or abstract contract>>
        +providerKey() String
        +pay(amount) PaymentResult
    }

    class CardPayment {
        +providerKey() String
        +pay(amount) PaymentResult
    }

    class UPIPayment {
        +providerKey() String
        +pay(amount) PaymentResult
    }

    class PaymentResult {
        <<immutable result>>
        +provider String
        +amount number
        +status String
        +message String
    }

    PaymentProcessor o--> PaymentStrategy : registers and selects
    PaymentStrategy <|.. CardPayment : implements
    PaymentStrategy <|.. UPIPayment : implements
    PaymentProcessor ..> PaymentResult : returns
    CardPayment ..> PaymentResult : creates
    UPIPayment ..> PaymentResult : creates

    note for PaymentProcessor "Standalone Part 3 implementation only. Shopizer's RazorpayPayment is a separate Part 2 production class and is intentionally not shown here."
